concept:telecommunications-amendment-act-1988-sec-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 Section 2"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Subject to subsections (2) and (3), this Act commences on the day on which it receives the Royal Assent. (2) Sections 5, 6, 10, 12 and 13 and subsections 23 (2) and 26 (1) commence on a day to be fixed by Proclamation for the purposes of this subsection.  Telecommunications Amendment No. 121, 1988 (3) Section 14 and subsections 23 (3) and 26 (2) commence on a day to be fixed by Proclamation for the purposes of this subsection. PART II—AMENDMENTS OF THE TELECOMMUNICATIONS ACT Principal Act" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Subject to subsections (2) and (3), this Act commences on the day on which it receives the Royal Assent. (2) Sections 5, 6, 10, 12 and 13 and subsections 23 (2) and 26 (1) commence on a day to be fixed by Proclamation for the purposes of this subsection.  Telecommunications Amendment No. 121, 1988 (3) Section 14 and subsections 23 (3) and 26 (2) commence on a day to be fixed by Proclamation for the purposes of this subsection. PART II—AMENDMENTS OF THE TELECOMMUNICATIONS ACT Principal Act"@en ;
