concept:telecommunications-amendment-act-1988-sec-22 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22 After section 110 of the Principal Act the following sections are"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-22 ;
    values:originalText "inserted: Public Works Committee Act \"110A. The Public Works Committee Act 1969 does not apply in relation to the Commission. Lands Acquisition Act \"110B. ( 1 ) The Lands Acquisition Act 1955 does not apply in relation to the acquisition of land, or an interest in land, by the Commission by agreement.  Telecommunications Amendment No. 121, 1988 \"(2) In subsection (1): 'interest', in relation to land, means: (a) a legal or equitable estate or interest in the land; or (b) a right, power or privilege over, or in relation to, the land.\". Consequential and minor amendments of Principal Act" ;
    skos:definition "inserted: Public Works Committee Act \"110A. The Public Works Committee Act 1969 does not apply in relation to the Commission. Lands Acquisition Act \"110B. ( 1 ) The Lands Acquisition Act 1955 does not apply in relation to the acquisition of land, or an interest in land, by the Commission by agreement.  Telecommunications Amendment No. 121, 1988 \"(2) In subsection (1): 'interest', in relation to land, means: (a) a legal or equitable estate or interest in the land; or (b) a right, power or privilege over, or in relation to, the land.\". Consequential and minor amendments of Principal Act"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4a9e3a87651ae441b3c54d84d60c61b5280cf2a659e40f0611151ad82f1639b7" ;
    cof:pageNumber "16"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Inserts sections from other acts" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-amendment-act-1988.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-amendment-act-1988.pdf, p.16" ;
    cml:asserts concept:telecommunications-amendment-act-1988-sec-22-norm .
