concept:telecommunications-amendment-act-1988-sec-29 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "29 Section 29"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-29 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A delegation given under section 33 of the Principal Act (other than a delegation of the Commission's powers under subsection 11 (2) of the Principal Act) and in force immediately before the commencement of section 12 of this Act has effect, after that commencement, as if it were a delegation given under section 10B of the Principal Act as amended by this Act. (2) A delegation given under section 33 of the Principal Act (being a delegation of the Commission's powers under subsection 11 (2) of the Principal Act) and in force immediately before the commencement of section 12 of this Act has effect, after that commencement, as if it were a delegation given under subsection 27 (1) of the Principal Act as amended by this Act. (3) If section 12 of this Act commences before section 14 of this Act, section 10B and paragraph 27 (1) (b) of the Principal Act as amended by this Act have effect, after the commencement of section 12 of this Act and until the commencement of section 14 of this Act, as if a reference to an employee were a reference to an officer or employee of the Corporation. Existing Managing Director" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A delegation given under section 33 of the Principal Act (other than a delegation of the Commission's powers under subsection 11 (2) of the Principal Act) and in force immediately before the commencement of section 12 of this Act has effect, after that commencement, as if it were a delegation given under section 10B of the Principal Act as amended by this Act. (2) A delegation given under section 33 of the Principal Act (being a delegation of the Commission's powers under subsection 11 (2) of the Principal Act) and in force immediately before the commencement of section 12 of this Act has effect, after that commencement, as if it were a delegation given under subsection 27 (1) of the Principal Act as amended by this Act. (3) If section 12 of this Act commences before section 14 of this Act, section 10B and paragraph 27 (1) (b) of the Principal Act as amended by this Act have effect, after the commencement of section 12 of this Act and until the commencement of section 14 of this Act, as if a reference to an employee were a reference to an officer or employee of the Corporation. Existing Managing Director"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "53f8b02a57eb95c8b5899d5657f9fe7187d1f067762c4d339f1deda935808fc0" ;
    cof:pageNumber "18"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-amendment-act-1988-sec-29-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-amendment-act-1988-sec-29-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:telecommunications-amendment-act-1988-sec-29-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-amendment-act-1988.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-amendment-act-1988.pdf, p.18" .
